@startuml
[*] --> IN_STOCK
IN_STOCK --> RESERVED : reserve
IN_STOCK --> UNSERVICEABLE : mark unserviceable
RESERVED --> IN_STOCK : cancel reservation
RESERVED --> ISSUED : issue
ISSUED --> INSTALLED : fit
ISSUED --> UNSERVICEABLE : failure
INSTALLED --> UNSERVICEABLE : remove
UNSERVICEABLE --> IN_STOCK : repair return
@enduml
